    "text": "By Ellie Nakamoto-White ,\n8 hours ago SUSSEX, Wis. (CBS 58) -- Two people are facing charges after court documents allege they broke into a Sussex home and stole cash and multiple firearms. Records obtained by CBS 58 say Samuel Stryker, 17, and Kielee Sonnemann, 19, along with other teens, burglarized a residence on Silver Spring Drive in September. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
